ault exists; a margin of 100 percent or more reuses `INVALID MARGIN` and its text; the source order (sell override, catalogue sell, catalogue default percent, section) and the no-default rule are kept. **The coordinator's design call under the product owner's sell-basis ruling, stated as such: a line's OWN explicit margin wins over its section's method, and under a margin section a line cannot opt back to markup (a line's method defaults to markup and so cannot say "unset"); it changes no existing price. Grade it as a stated design choice (Note) if the register row says it; a Major only if the code does something else than the row says.**
